+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-1-1">This RFC specifies a method for assigning long addresses in the
+HOST-PORT specification for the data port to be used in establishing
+a data connection for File Transfer Protocol, FTP (STD 9, RFC 959).
+This is a general solution, applicable for all &quot;next generation&quot; IP
+alternatives, and can also be extended to allow FTP operation over
+transport interfaces other than TCP.</t>
